    "biography": "<p>Ralph was a \"peaked in high school\" jock with a sharp mind and bad grades, has spent the last 10 years moving from scam to job to scam to job, with surprisingly good computer skills and easy charm he has always found a way to get away and get ahead, his most recent con was too successful stealing paychecks from a new gig economy app, that app was a tool created by a Camarilla Nosferatu who tracked him down and seeing a pretty boy with computer skills, saw an opportunity to both punish something beautiful and make a useful tool, after seeing Ralph not \"Turn Ugly\" he became enraged, snaped his neck thinking the embrace was a failure and left him for dead.</p>",
